# DefiLlama Pro API key (OPTIONAL). The free /pools endpoint returns only a UUID
# (no contract address). With a Pro key, /yields/poolsOld exposes `pool_old` =
# the pool's on-chain address, letting the ContractRegistry resolve arbitrary
# per-pool protocols (vaults, long-tail) — "Tier B". WITHOUT it, singleton
# protocols (Aave/Compound/Lido/Morpho/Spark/Rocket/Sceptre) still resolve via
# verified per-chain tables — "Tier A". Safe Markets core actions work on all
# chains with NO key; the Pro key only widens coverage.
# DEFILLAMA_API_KEY=
# DEFILLAMA_PRO_URL=https://pro-api.llama.fi

